{
 "comment": "Critic scenario: breaking news. Night, so all three stations are on air. Radios: 1035 at (0,-60,3), 670 at (3,-60,3), 1440 at (6,-60,3), 850 at (-3,-60,3), and a switched-off 1035 at (9,-60,3). Bulletin on Radio Tejo: only the 1035 radio interrupts; late tuners and a late power-on join mid-clip; it ends after the clip or with 'breaking clear' and the schedule resumes. A second command replaces the first. Error cases: unknown station, no argument, wrong case. Chat stays in the shots.",
